  "SC02": "A +4 down_proj entry adds 4 times neuron 320's activation to one residual dim at layer 20; activations are usually sub-unit so the effect is small and late.",
  "SC03": "Zeroing one final-norm dim shifts every logit by an embedding entry times an order-one value, with no downstream propagation; small either-sign effect.",
